      "summary": "Magic weapon gives a weapon a +1 enhancement bonus on attack and damage rolls",
      "value": "<p>Magic weapon gives a weapon a +1 enhancement bonus on attack and damage rolls. An enhancement bonus does not stack with a masterwork weapon’s +1 bonus on attack rolls. You can’t cast this spell on a natural weapon, such as an unarmed strike. This spell only affects one end of a double-weapon as usual. Multiple enhancement bonuses on the same object do not stack. Only the highest enhancement bonus applies.</p>"
